---
description: Testing evidence for finished tasks; Android packages only when asked
alwaysApply: true
---

When a task or build is finished, include testing evidence the user can watch: a screen recording of the changed flow, or screenshots when a recording does not apply. Show the feature working, not only the code.

Do not export or push an APK or AAB unless the user explicitly asks for an Android build. Those packages cost money to produce. When they do ask, export both an APK and an AAB, name them with the version (for example FlickDisc-1.2.0.apk and FlickDisc-1.2.0.aab), and push those files so they can be downloaded from the branch. Do not replace an older version's file. The package id is com.hikarutech.flickdisc and the app name is FlickDisc.
